title: Folk Ballad in Twelve
key: E
tempo: 60
meter: 12/8
style: acoustic

// The slow folk ballad in twelve-eight: four slow pulses to the bar, three
// eighths in each. The verse leaves home for the four over its own bass note,
// sits on the six minor, and turns home through the two and the five, a chord
// a half bar; the chorus starts on the four, climbs to the five and the three
// minor, and ends on the five to turn back; the bridge climbs from the six
// minor through the five over its third to home, and from the two minor up to
// the five.
[Verse]
| E   | A/E | E       | B7 |
| C#m | A   | F#m7 B7 | E  |

[Chorus]
| A | B | G#m | C#m |
| A | B | E   | B7  |

[Bridge]
| C#m  | B/D# | E | A  |
| F#m7 | G#m  | A | B7 |

[Chorus]
